        "note": "<div class=\"Example\"><table class=\"example\"><tr><td><p><i>h=</i></p></td><td><p>2nd sg. hon.</p></td><td><p>- 2nd plural actor clitic is used as honorific form of</p><p>address if the addressee is older than the speaker;</p><p>- plural is also indicator of respect when adressing/ referringto an individual of greater age than speaker</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><i>meu</i></p></td><td><p>2nd sg. hon.</p></td><td><p>- 2nd plural pronoun is used as honorific form of address if theaddressee is older than the speaker</p></td></tr></table><p>- free pronouns are used in all syntactic functions, a</p><p>set of clitic pronouns is used for actor cross referencing;</p><p>- plural is also indicator of respect when adressing/</p><p>referring to an individual of greater age than speaker</p></div>",
